The Captures page incorrectly imports MainLayout from '@/app/layout' when it should be imported from '@/components/main-layout'. This will cause a runtime error because the default export of '@/app/layout' is the RootLayout component, not MainLayout.

File: packages/web/app/captures/page.tsx
Line: 1
Incorrect: import { MainLayout } from '@/app/layout';
Should be: import { MainLayout } from '@/components/main-layout';
